==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dɪˈteɪn/}}
* {{audio|En-us-detain.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|eɪn}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# Keep (someone) from proceeding by holding them back or making claims on their attention.
# {{context|transitive}} To put under [[custody]].
# {{context|transitive}} To keep back or from; to withhold.
#* Jeremy Taylor
#*: '''Detain''' not the wages of the hireling.

